00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:39,750
Peter is searching for his long-lost sister when he crosses
paths with a fortune teller in the market square.

4
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:51,000
His only question is: is his sister still alive?

5
00:30:56,250 --> 00:31:02,250
The answer, that he must find a mysterious elephant and the magician who will conjure it, sets Peter off on a
journey to complete three seemingly impossible tasks that will change the face of his town forever.

