12
01:14:15,000 --> 01:14:21,000
The Magician's Elephant is a 2023 animated fantasy adventure film directed by
Wendy Rogers, written by Martin Hynes and produced by Julia Pistor.

13
01:20:26,250 --> 01:20:32,250
Based on the 2009 novel by Kate DiCamillo, the film features the voices of Noah Jupe, Mandy
Patinkin, Natasia Demetriou, Benedict Wong, Miranda Richardson and Aasif Mandvi.

14
01:26:37,500 --> 01:26:43,500
